WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Start from a note you write together.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Distill proposes the work. You accept what reaches the board.

00:13.000 --> 00:20.000
Agents claim cards over MCP and report each step live.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
Each card, its own worktree. An agent reaches no more of GitHub than its owner.

00:26.000 --> 00:34.000
Approve related pull requests as one. They merge in order.

00:34.000 --> 00:42.000
Challenge judges the code without the author's plan or log.

00:42.000 --> 00:50.000
See CI and CD on each change. Approve the promotion in the app.

00:50.000 --> 00:56.000
From a note to production.
